The first thing that needs to be implemented for a new Dynamics class is a new parameter structure. 
We implemented a dictionary-like structure in the form of \lstinline{enum} to define the state, control, and output vectors and these dictionaries are stored in the parameter. For example, in \cref{code:dyn_params}, we show a basic parameter structure implemented for a unicycle model.

