    \hline
        Approach & Precision & Recall & Escape & Misintercept \\ \hline
        SSQLC2: 7B & 76.54\% & 89.39\% & 10.61\% & 16.26\% \\ 
        SSQLC2: 70B & 74.2\% & 97.05\% & 2.95\% & 19.87\% \\ \hline
        SSQLC3: 8B & 79.31\% & 98.09\% & 1.91\% & 15.07\% \\ 
        SSQLC3: 70B & 80.01\% & 98.42\% & 1.58\% & 14.47\% \\ \hline
        SSQLC3.1: 8B & 71.7\% & 91.72\% & 8.28\% & 21.23\% \\ 
        SSQLC3.1: 70B & 90.52\% & 94.38\% & 5.62\% & 5.82\% \\ \hline
