The results of the experiment were highly encouraging, Figure \ref{fig:roc} indicates that our interceptors provide robust protection against malicious SQL commands. By effectively identifying and blocking malicious actions, our system ensures the stable operation of the server, safeguarding against potential disruptions and data breaches. This demonstrates the critical role of our SQL syntax checker and security checker in fortifying the system's defenses against malicious attacks and ensuring the reliability and security of data processing operations.

