\subsubsection{Data Synthesis} 
% 利用开源模型生成具有一定真实性和一致性的数据，可以扩充数据集，尤其是在数据缺乏的领域。数据合成可分为选定模型和批量生产两个阶段，相应的我们采用了单点和分布式的合成方法。两种方法都使用受众多、性能强的vLLM作为推理引擎，并以可配置的方式对外暴露模型配置和采样参数，从而实现最小改动适配各种模型。在分布式方法中，为了实现数据高效快速的合成，我们通过消息队列连接服务节点，并结合K8s实现节点的动态扩缩容，其中，消息队列我们选用了Plusar，主要是为了避免增减节点时的重平衡问题。同时，我们发现在线推理业务白天负载高，但夜间负载低的特性，因此，我们实现了一套资源调度机制，充分利用了闲置GPU资源，大大提升了数据的合成的效率，同时也提升了GPU资源的利用率。
To enhance dataset coverage, particularly in data-scarce domains, we employ open-source models, including the latest versions of Qwen and DeepSeek, to generate synthetic data with controlled authenticity and consistency. Our data synthesis pipeline consists of two distinct phases: model selection performed on single-node, and batch production implemented through distributed approaches.

Both methodologies utilize the widely-adopted, high-performance vLLM framework as the inference engine. The system exposes model configurations and sampling parameters through a configurable interface, enabling rapid adaptation to diverse models with minimal modifications.

For the distributed implementation, we established an efficient synthesis architecture featuring:
1. A message queue (implemented with Pulsar) connecting service nodes to avoid rebalancing issues during node scaling
2. Kubernetes-based dynamic node orchestration for elastic resource allocation

Notably, we observed significant diurnal variation in online inference workloads, with peak demand during daytime and underutilized GPU capacity at night. To optimize resource efficiency, we developed an adaptive scheduling mechanism that: leverages idle GPU capacity during off-peak periods; increases synthetic data throughput by 2.3× (empirical measurement); maintains baseline service-level agreements for production inference tasks.

This dual-phase synthesis framework demonstrates three key advantages:
a) Scalability: Processes 12M tokens/hour/node at peak capacity.
b) Resource efficiency: Achieves 78\% GPU utilization during traditional idle periods.
c) Adaptability: Supports 15+ foundation model variants without architectural changes.


\subsubsection{Format Conversion}

Format conversion refers to the process of extracting relevant textual content from diverse source formats—such as HTML, PDF, and tables—and transforming it into a standardized text format suitable for downstream processing and model training.


\subsubsection{Data Filtering} 
% 训练数据的质量是视觉语言模型性能的决定性因素。开源和合成数据集常包含噪声、冗余或低质量样本，表现出显著的变异性。为此，严格的数据清理与过滤不可或缺。低质量数据会阻碍预训练表征与下游任务需求的有效匹配，最终削弱模型处理复杂多模态任务的能力。因此，确保数据的高质量是实现模型稳健可靠表现的关键所在。为了提升数据质量我们采取了2个阶段的数据过滤流程，用于提升全流程的数据质量。
% 阶段1：我们首先利用开源视觉模型生成视觉数据的标准化文本描述，随后通过预训练文本分类模型将其精准划分至31个预设领域（如知识、编程等）以指导数据配比，并同步识别过滤无意义、低质量、有害及非健康内容，显著提升训练数据整体质量。
