we will record the dirty buffers generated according to the DAG. 
After all the buffers have been copied,
we will retransmit all the dirty buffers as well as the unfinished kernel DAG (\ding{185}).

The above design may encounter a large number of dirty buffers 
due to the fast execution nature of the GPU. 
To reduce the transfer of delta pages, we selectively delay the kernel execution 
if the existing delta pages exceed a threshold (\ding{184}).

