To test whether different RAG systems can reason over a document's {\em temporal} and {\em causal consistency}, we introduce \textbf{\benchmark}—a  QA benchmark built from nine narrative works spanning novels, musical scripts and children's stories.\footnote{The underlying literary works are in the public domain in the United States.  
