\noindent$\bullet$ \textit{Causal Consistency} – cause and effect, logical sequences, or explanations of how events unfolded.  

\noindent$\bullet$ \textit{Character \& Behavioural Consistency} – character motivations, development, or psychology.  

\noindent$\bullet$  \textit{Setting, Environment \& Atmosphere} – physical locations, time periods, or mood/atmosphere

\noindent$\bullet$ \textit{Symbolism, Imagery \& Motifs} – symbolic elements, recurring imagery, or metaphorical representations. 

\noindent$\bullet$ \textit{Thematic, Philosophical \& Moral} – deeper meanings, philosophical ideas, or ethical implications

\noindent$\bullet$ \textit{Narrative \& Plot Structure} – story organization, plot devices, or narrative techniques.

\noindent$\bullet$ \textit{Social, Cultural \& Political} – societal contexts, cultural elements, or political dimensions.

\noindent$\bullet$ \textit{Emotional \& Psychological} – emotional responses, psychological states, or mental processes\@.  
% \end{itemize}

The questions from each category require solid understanding grounded on the progression of the story and cause-and-effect of the elements involved in the plot. Our \textbf{\benchmark} closes the aforementioned gap with:

  \noindent$\bullet$ \textbf{Focus on temporal and causal consistency} — each query hinges on a character's \emph{specific temporal facet} (e.g.\ "after the troll incident"), so retrieving an early-story snippet fails.

    \noindent$\bullet$  \textbf{Passage-level supervision} — every answer is paired with exact start/end byte offsets, making verification straightforward and reliable.

    \noindent$\bullet$  \textbf{Unrestricted accessibility} — every narrative is drawn from Project Gutenberg, putting the full texts in the public domain. Unlike fully private benchmark, This guarantees that anyone can obtain, inspect, and redistribute the benchmark data without restrictions.

Thus ChronoQA tests whether a RAG system can (1) fetch the right snippet when the full story cannot fit into context and (2) reason over evolving entity states that standard KG de-duplication erases.

