Also, we highlight the effectiveness of using the OpenAI Gym (Gymnasium) interface with Ark to allow easy adaptations to the policy.
An overview of Ark's data collection nodes are shown in Figure~\ref{fig:data_collection}.

We showcase two methods for imitation learning:
(i) diffusion policy,
(ii) action chunking with transformers, and
