    \caption{Number of theses by College hosted on KiltHub. Colleges are: School of Computer Sciences (SCS), Dietrich College of Humanities and Social Sciences (DCHSC), Tepper School of Business, College of Fine Arts (CFA), College of Engineering (CE) and Mellon College of Science (MCS). Heinz College of Information Systems and Public Policy is not included in the plot since it only had 13 theses.}
